# P13 (M13-003): both images now COPY the whole workspace, because a bun
# workspace install has to see every member's manifest and the old
# hand-maintained per-package COPY list drifted silently. That makes the build
# context worth trimming — everything below is either regenerated inside the
# image or never read by it.
**/.next
**/.output
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
# Regenerated by `bun run codegen` in the api image's build stage; shipping the
# host's copies risks baking a stale Prisma client or an old geo database.
packages/db/src/generated
**/GeoLite2-*.mmdb
tmp
